# Parallel build configuration.
# -T 1C = 1 build thread per CPU core. Enables parallel reactor builds AND parallel
# test execution where supported. Module-level concurrency relies on the reactor
# graph respecting <dependency> ordering — which our parent pom does correctly.
-T 1C

# Maven 3.9+ task-output build cache. Skips recompilation when inputs are unchanged.
# Disable per-invocation with `-Dmaven.build.cache.enabled=false` if you suspect cache
# corruption.
-Dmaven.build.cache.enabled=true
